title Caravan entrust -- a line may also grow, and growing is the harder half
prompt Kyri first, then REMEMBER and the road-ahead itineraries; Standfast on reds, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; council rota one doc; send each finished increment
think Standfast first. Walked crux/REDS.md whole -- rows 80, 83, 84, 85 all read closed, the prose notes for 81, 82, 85-reopened, 86, 87 likewise, and the two guards the last laps booked (e123 living-pin, living-card ASCII) stand GREEN per the card. Nothing agent-closable was open, so the line was clear for constructive work.
think Council rota by lap index: 483 .kyri logs on disk when the lap opened, so lap 484, and 484 mod 27 = 25 -- active-designing/20260816-205859_double-seat-expansion-eight-seasons.md, which the prompt names as road-ahead reading too. Deep-read whole. Its Lindy-priority line places the Microkernel Target double-seat ahead of Seasons A-H, which is exactly where this arc lives.
think The running thread was unambiguous. All three newest logs -- taper, unhand, understudy -- close on the same recommend, each naming the next rung more sharply than the last: whether a supervisor may hand a running child a WIDER line, work arriving for a child already in flight rather than leaving it. taper.rye's own module prose and its witness both named it as the vision room's until a witness binds it. This lap binds it.
think The first design question was whether the mirror is really a mirror, and it is not. A shrink is safe by construction: the door already weighed the wider line when it admitted every sibling, so narrowing can only free room. A widening reaches for arcs the door never weighed, beside siblings admitted against the narrower line. That asymmetry is the whole rung -- it is why the widening earns two refusals the shrink never needed.
think The second question was how to keep the shape one number, since taper's elegance was that an ordered walk holds a suffix and a handback is therefore a single byte. A widening is not a suffix of anything the child already has. The answer was a reserve: a phase carries, beside the line it hands at spawn, arcs the supervisor may entrust later, written in the same grammar. Then the widened line is the handed line followed by a prefix of the reserve, and an entrustment is one number again.
think The third question was how the arcs physically reach a running child. A capability word rides in argv at spawn and nothing carries one afterward -- cohort derives a child's peer count from argv length, so appending extra words would break the fallback path outright. So the child is spawned narrowed to its widest possible line (its own arcs plus its whole reserve) while its plan word names only the line, and it reads its reserve back off its own capability slot in grant order. No word is handed twice, and no argv shape moves.
think That choice has a real cost and I named it in the module, the README, and the witness rather than letting it pass: the child physically holds reach the door has not yet weighed, so this rung's isolation claim is about the WORK a child is permitted to do rather than the reach it holds. A real microkernel hands a capability into a running child's cspace; a process boundary cannot. Carrying a capability over a channel into a child already running is the next rung's question.
think The fourth question was what an entrustment costs in trust. A handback was a fact the run took in -- the child had already stopped using the arc, so believing it was safe. An entrustment is an act, and a run that entrusted work to a child which had already exited would believe work done that was never read. So the supervisor publishes, then waits bounded for the child to answer, and only then widens the line it remembers. A silent child earns EntrustUnheard and the whole record is refused rather than quietly under-run.
obs The two rooms disagree on a genuinely different axis than the rung below. taper measured more children at once; entrust measures FEWER CHILDREN for the same work -- 4 phases run twice, 4 children with a child of its own for every phase against 3 with work handed to the child already standing, 1 coming home either way. The economy is the opposite one, which is what makes the pair worth having rather than one being the other read backwards.
obs All six RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN was claimed. Drop the direction refusal and a line takes work back from a child already carrying it. Drop the length half of the supply guard and the depth half still refuses -- honest, since both halves are the same refusal; drop both and the walk panics at reached unreachable on the invariant that exactly the entrusted prefix was taken on. Drop the reach refusal and a line reaching for a write the document never granted reads as within. Drop the room refusal and a widening reaches a region a sibling was already reading. Never entrust at all and the run reports that a standing child with a reserve was entrusted nothing. Entrust and never wait for an answer, and the run refuses the whole record with EntrustUnheard.
obs The metal named a fixture bug I had reasoned wrong. My first contention fixture had client_a reaching for a write on menu, which the document grants only as a read -- so EntrustUngranted fired before EntrustContended and the refusal I meant to prove was unreachable. Rewrote the pair so a client_a holding menu reaches for a write on board beside a client_b reading it, which is a grant the document does make and a hazard the room must catch. Measurement beats memory, again, and on the very check meant to measure.
obs The generalization test carried over whole, as it has every rung: with no reserve handed anywhere, every pair reads exactly as unhand.admissible_held reads it, all 9 pairs. That is what makes this a strict widening rather than a gamble -- a run that entrusts nothing is the rung below, unchanged.
obs Docs stayed synced in the same round. taper.rye's README section said the wider-line question belonged to the vision room until a witness binds it, and a witness now binds it, so that sentence points at Entrust instead. The module table gained its row in the same edit rather than drifting behind again, which is the ratchet the last lap opened.
loom witness=caravan_entrust_witness result=GREEN phases=4 children_fresh=4 children_entrusted=3 entrusted=1 absorbed=1 homed=1 pairs_agreed=9 red_paths_proven=6
file caravan/entrust.rye a line may also grow -- the reserve, the widened line, five refusals, and the supervisor that publishes forward
file tools/caravan_entrust_witness.rish the witness on metal, reading every claim natively and naming all six proven RED paths
file caravan/README.md the Entrust section, the module table row, and taper's limit line repointed now that a witness binds it
recommend keep-going the next rung's question is already named and is the one this rung could not reach: carrying a capability over a channel into a child already running, so a widened line grants reach as well as work. Mechanical, single-module, and the arc's own habit answers how to shape it. The caravan witness loom -- 49 per-rung witnesses and no choir that hears them all -- stands beside it as an equally honest keystone, and it has now been named as a ratchet twice.
